C2 VoutP net1 1p
XCH1 net11 net10 net12 net13 PHIch ideal_chopper
XCH2 net7 net6 net2 net8 PHIch ideal_chopper
XM1 net3 VB1 VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
